        {
          "text": "Na mũtikavukye nthĩ ĩla mũtũĩte, ĩla nyie nĩtũaa nthĩnĩ wayo: nũndũ nyie, Yeova, nĩtũaa katĩ wa ana ma Isilaeli. ",
